## Rollback policy

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    D["Deploy"] --> H{"Health checks<br/>and error budget OK?"}
    H -->|yes| M["Monitor"]
    H -->|no| R["Roll back to previous release"]
    R --> P["Post-mortem and exec-plan"]
```

- Every release must be revertible without a data migration; otherwise it needs an exec-plan with a forward-fix strategy.
